[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0051","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0051.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0064","title":"Nortel Contivity HTTP Server cgiproc CGI 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Nortel Contivity HTTP Server 1.0 的 cgiproc CGI 脚本存在元字符注入漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向目标服务器发送包含 shell 元字符的特制 URL，导致 CGI 程序执行意外的系统命令，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Nortel Contivity 1.0 版本，无需认证即可远程触发，攻击条件简单，危害中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0064"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-01-17T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:55.610","remediation":"升级 Nortel Contivity HTTP Server 至 1.0 以上已修复版本；如无法升级，建议在 Web 服务器配置中禁用或移除 cgiproc CGI 脚本，并在网络边界防火墙上限制对 HTTP 服务的访问来源 IP，同时对用户输入进行严格过滤，禁止 shell 元字符传入。该产品已停止维护，建议迁移至受支持的安全替代方案。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.osvdb.org/7583","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/938","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4603507d019be3585b2e7bcddcb6c6f57901b490/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0064.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0064","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0064.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/cae595683b6fe65324ec717750e7cdca928c1db7/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0064.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/f5ee58102af366026efb2988554e99ff8cc7a609/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-x983-ghxv-8xc2/GHSA-x983-ghxv-8xc2.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/snort/drop-rules/web-cgi.rules","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/N/nortel_cgiproc_dos.nasl","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0064.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001103.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--8b4d925a-4ac4-4a9c-bcd7-8df5b55f31bf.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0051.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0050","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0050.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0063","title":"Nortel Contivity HTTP Server CGI 任意文件读取漏洞","description":"Nortel Contivity HTTP 服务器的 cgiproc CGI 脚本存在任意文件读取漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向该脚本传入指定文件名参数，读取服务器上的任意文件，导致敏感信息泄露。该漏洞影响 Nortel Contivity 系列 VPN 设备，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0063"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-01-17T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:55.487","remediation":"立即禁用 contivity HTTP 服务器上的 cgiproc CGI 脚本（删除或重命名该脚本文件），或升级到 Nortel 官方发布的最新固件版本。如无法升级，在反向代理或防火墙层面阻止对 `/cgiproc` 路径的外部访问请求，并将该设备隔离在网络边界，避免暴露在公网。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/938","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4603507d019be3585b2e7bcddcb6c6f57901b490/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0063.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0063","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0063.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/cae595683b6fe65324ec717750e7cdca928c1db7/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0063.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/f5ee58102af366026efb2988554e99ff8cc7a609/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-jq6c-6f3m-2jr3/GHSA-jq6c-6f3m-2jr3.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/snort/drop-rules/web-cgi.rules","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0063.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152100_152200.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001102.txt","https://github.com/InfoSecWarrior/Vulnerable-Box-Resources/blob/c784bcf63e1ec5c3a0116043d8653d00f0a21a0b/Vulnhub/OZ/oz-1-nikto-80-output.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0050.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0061","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0061.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0075","title":"Nosque MsgCore 1.9 内存泄漏拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Nosque MsgCore 1.9（原名 Super Mail Transfer Package，SMTP）存在内存泄漏漏洞。远程攻击者无需认证，只需在同一会话中重复发送 HELO、MAIL FROM、RCPT TO 和 DATA 等 SMTP 命令，即可导致服务器内存资源被逐渐耗尽，最终造成拒绝服务（DoS）。该漏洞利用方式简单，无需特殊权限或复杂工具，攻击者仅需通过 Telnet 或 netcat 等基本网络工具即可发起攻击，影响 MsgCore 1.9 版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0075"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-01-13T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:56.910","remediation":"建议升级到 MsgCore 2.0 或更高版本，该版本已修复内存泄漏问题。如无法升级，可在 SMTP 服务端配置中限制同一会话的 HELO/MAIL/RCPT 命令重复次数，或通过防火墙限制对 25 端口的访问来源 IP。作为临时缓解措施，可配置监控脚本定期重启 SMTP 服务进程以释放泄漏的内存。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/930","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19725","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/ad6ba3d27513a57837704589c10c0be969a18efd/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0075.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0075","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0075.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1d32b25dbea4bacedc1131a8702fa8adcc181eee/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0075.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d34115c5df8a79b3a76d7097ef910b9992c9ee85/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-4992-6p77-x2cp/GHSA-4992-6p77-x2cp.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0075.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_4.list.dict","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001101.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/3f03bd7f1d1606d853ca070d5f0897c51e140c86/2000.tsv","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_dos.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0061.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0052","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0052.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0066","title":"O'Reilly Website Professional 目录路径泄露漏洞","description":"O'Reilly Website Professional Web 服务器存在目录路径泄露漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证，通过向目标服务器发送特制的畸形 URL 请求（如包含非预期字符或过长的路径名），即可获取 Web 目录的真实物理路径信息。该漏洞属于信息泄露类型，可被攻击者利用来探测服务器文件系统结构，为后续攻击收集目标环境信息。影响 Website Professional 全版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0066"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-01-13T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:55.843","remediation":"安装 O'Reilly WebSite Pro 官方提供的免费 WSAPI 扩展，配置自定义 404/403/401 错误页面以隐藏真实目录路径。同时限制服务器返回的错误信息详细程度，避免在 404 响应中暴露物理路径。该产品已于 2000 年代停止维护，建议迁移至 Apache、Nginx 等仍在安全更新的 Web 服务器。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-2000-0066","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2000/CVE-2000-0066.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4382b0b8593e7ef30616ab300314afbbf1571636/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0066.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0066","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/919d6cac5eadae13826d4a35bab84cf2bac57965/2000/CVE-2000-0066.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0066.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/cae595683b6fe65324ec717750e7cdca928c1db7/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0066.json","https://github.com/Freem93/grammar_nasl_v2/blob/63834ebb8cd6e97050e155291c7500ad53bb20c6/plugins/website_pro.nasl","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--92542821-711e-4123-a0d8-22922cbd91a7.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001100.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0052.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0052.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0072","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0072.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0087","title":"Netscape Communicator 邮件通知 IMAP SSL 绕过漏洞","description":"Netscape Communicator 的 Mail Notification (nsnotify) 工具在处理 IMAP 邮件连接时存在安全绕过漏洞。即使管理员已在浏览器设置中指定使用 SSL 加密连接，该工具仍会以明文方式建立 IMAP 会话，导致用户在登录邮箱时的用户名和密码在网络传输过程中被未加密暴露。攻击者通过在网络链路中进行嗅探即可截获这些凭据信息，从而获取受害者的邮件访问权限。该漏洞影响 Netscape Communicator 系列浏览器及邮件客户端。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0087"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-01-12T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:58.403","remediation":"升级 Netscape Communicator 至 4.72 以上版本，该版本修复了 nsnotify 忽略 SSL 首选项的问题。如无法升级，可在客户端与 IMAP 服务器之间部署 Stunnel 建立 TLS 加密隧道，强制所有 IMAP 流量加密传输。同时建议迁移至持续维护的邮件客户端（如 Thunderbird），避免使用已停止支持的软件收发敏感邮件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://ma