-06-16T21:50:56.313","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS00-003 提供的补丁程序。Windows NT 4.0 Workstation/Server/Enterprise Edition 用户请从 Microsoft Download Center 下载并安装对应补丁（Intel 版或 Alpha 版）；Windows NT 4.0 Server Terminal Server Edition 用户请升级至 Service Pack 6。如无法立即打补丁，建议限制用户交互式登录权限，仅允许受信任用户从键盘登录服务器以降低风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://support.microsoft.com/default.aspx?scid=kb%3B%5BLN%5D%3BQ247869","http://www.bindview.com/security/advisory/adv_NtImpersonate.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/934","http://xforce.iss.net/search.php3?type=2&pattern=nt-spoofed-lpc-port","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-003","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4382b0b8593e7ef30616ab300314afbbf1571636/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0070.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0070","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0070.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/cae595683b6fe65324ec717750e7cdca928c1db7/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0070.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/29756569ae7c866e39492d6faf2dcdff310590f7/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-7c6r-7p46-359r/GHSA-7c6r-7p46-359r.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--99611cb0-8d9a-4f96-8642-43afab66e0c0.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0070.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001098.txt","https://github.com/Yuning-J/NVDFeatureAnalysis/blob/493a57a415cc110f9945148abd717eeb92f6ca7e/originalDataset/cveIDThreatType/cve_idgainpre"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0057.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0040","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0040.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0048","title":"Corel Linux OS 1.0 get_it 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"Corel Linux OS 1.0 的 get_it 程序存在 PATH 环境变量操纵漏洞，本地低权限用户可通过设置恶意的 PATH 环境变量，使 get_it 调用攻击者控制的恶意 cp 程序替代系统 cp，从而获取 root 权限。该漏洞影响 Corel Linux OS 1.0 版本，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。攻击者需拥有本地系统访问权限方可利用。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0048"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-01-12T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:53.630","remediation":"升级到 Corel Linux 的官方补丁版本，或修改 get_it 脚本中将 cp 等命令改为绝对路径（如 /bin/cp）；同时移除 get_it 的 setuid 位（chmod u-s /usr/bin/get_it），限制非信任用户执行。鉴于 Corel Linux 已停止维护，建议迁移至持续更新的发行版（如 Ubuntu/Debian）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://linux.corel.com/support/clos_patch1.htm","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/928","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19723","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a986b2f03c729ac57ae7d269a03d86211c579de0/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0048.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0048","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0048.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/834e72bf1d790a78930554cd283f772f3690fc67/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0048.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/412d717d6f053499cbceb993220b04e36c6778d7/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-vp5h-j8h3-xvg2/GHSA-vp5h-j8h3-xvg2.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0048.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_0.list.dict","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/e23a9add9eb7a204c43e0b2a3d73e474ee508d84/2000.tsv","https://github.com/Vasileios-Mavroeidis/semantic-stix-vulnerability/blob/30f07606133364b9623f401bc306c8c9cbcf9386/vulnerability/vulnerability--e16005b9-5841-4a01-90d1-9a5fa7ea2e65.owl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0040.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0040.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0040.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0208","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0208.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0074","title":"PowerScripts PlusMail WebConsole 弱认证漏洞","description":"PowerScripts PlusMail WebConsole 1.0 的 CGI 程序存在权限认证缺陷，密码文件权限设置不当，导致远程攻击者无需有效凭据即可通过直接访问或修改密码文件来执行任意命令。该漏洞影响 PlusMail WebConsole 1.0 版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高，攻击者利用此漏洞可完全控制目标邮件服务器。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0074"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-01-11T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:56.790","remediation":"立即将 PlusMail 密码文件权限修改为 600（仅所有者可读写），禁止密码文件存放于 Web 可访问目录下。通过 Web 服务器（如 Apache）配置对该 CGI 脚本实施 IP 白名单访问控制和额外 HTTP 基本认证。由于 PowerScripts 产品已停止维护且不再发布安全更新，建议迁移至仍保持维护的邮件管理平台以彻底消除风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-2000-0074","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20801","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/ad6ba3d27513a57837704589c10c0be969a18efd/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0074.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0074","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/919d6cac5eadae13826d4a35bab84cf2bac57965/2000/CVE-2000-0074.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0074.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d34115c5df8a79b3a76d7097ef910b9992c9ee85/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-3p8m-qpqj-m94w/GHSA-3p8m-qpqj-m94w.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1d32b25dbea4bacedc1131a8702fa8adcc181eee/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0074.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/P/plusmail.nasl","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152100_152200.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_5.list.dict"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0208.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0208.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0208.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0058","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0058.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0071","title":"Microsoft IIS 4.0 物理路径泄露漏洞","description":"IIS 4.0 存在信息泄露漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向服务器发送针对不存在的 .ida 或 .idq 扩展名文件的 HTTP 请求，获取 Web 文档根目录的真实物理路径。该漏洞可帮助攻击者进一步探测目标服务器系统结构及文件布局，为后续渗透攻击提供信息支撑。此漏洞影响 Microsoft IIS 4.0 版本，攻击复杂度低，无需身份认证，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0071"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-01-11T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:56.437","remediation":"立即将 IIS 4.0 升级至 IIS 6.0 或更高版本（IIS 4.0 已停止支持多年，无法通过补丁修复）。同时移除 IIS 中 .ida/.idq 的应用程序映射（网站属性 → 主目录 → 配置 → 删除 .ida/.idq 映射），并将 IIS 错误模式改为「自定义错误页」以隐藏真实路径。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=94770020309953&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=94780058006791&w=2","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4382b0b8593e7ef30616ab300314afbbf1571636/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0071.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0071","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0071.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1d32b25dbea4bacedc1131a8702fa8adcc181eee/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0071.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/29756569ae7c866e39492d6faf2dcdff310590f7/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-48f3-v7r7-48gh/GHSA-48f3-v7r7-48gh.json","https://github.com/marcellodesales/aibbp-reverse-engineer/blob/960f610d597aae9fec1cc5f03c68679be00c222d/reverse_engineer/acunetix/vulnerabilities/vdb/2000/0xxx/cve-2000-0071.yaml","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/pre2008/iis_anything_idq.nasl","https://github.com/feng-li/tools-for-data-science-course/blob/8e62d47ee8ffbebe9a0e50aee193617f83883118/2019spring/2017312271/result.txt","https://github.com/chihsuan/search-engine/blob/9dcdd3e644469883f53565740f0ba8ff617c5120/Data/E99D88C1-C798-40D7-BB8C-47E6405B9469.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0071.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0058.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0058.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0038","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0038.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0045","title":"MySQL GRANT 全局密码修改漏洞","description":"MySQL 3.22.27/3.22.29/3.23.8 版本存在权限管理缺陷，拥有 GRANT 权限的本地用户可利用 GRANT 语句修改任意 MySQL 用户的密码。攻击者只需具备本地数据库访问权限和 GRANT 授权即可触发该漏洞，无需额外认证。成功利用后可导致权限提升，获取其他用户的数据库访问控制权，影响数据库的完整性和机密性。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 6.4，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.4,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0045"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-01-11T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:53.257","remediation":"升级 MySQL 到 3.23.9 及以上版本，此漏洞已在后续版本中修复；限制 GRANT 权限仅授予受信任的管理员用户，避免将 GRANT 权限赋予普通用户；对于仍运行旧版本的系统，建议迁移至受支持的 MySQL 5.7 或 8.0 最新版本，并遵循最小权限原则分配用户权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/926","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19721","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2000/CVE-2000-0045.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a986b2f03c729ac57ae7d269a03d86211c579de0/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0045.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0045","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0045.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0045.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/68f861ef7056d26a199514826964f9781eeba15e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-2j9w-mc69-3577/GHSA-2j9w-mc69-3577.json","https://github.com/marcellodesales/aibbp-reverse-engineer/blob/960f610d597aae9fec1cc5f03c68679be00c222d/reverse_engineer/invicti/vulnerabilities/db/vulnerabilities/vdb/2000/0xxx/cve-2000-0045.yaml","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/M/mysql_flaws.nasl","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152000_152100.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0038.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0053","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0053.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0067","title":"CyberCash Merchant Connection Kit 本地符号链接攻击漏洞","description":"CyberCash Merchant Connection Kit（MCK）存在本地提权漏洞，本地攻击者可通过符号链接攻击（symlink attack）修改系统文件，获取更高权限或造成数据篡改。该漏洞影响 CyberCash MCK 组件，攻击者需要拥有本地系统访问权限，CVSS 评分 2.1，危害等级低。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0067"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-01-11","updated":"2026-06-16","remediation":"CyberCash MCK 已停止维护且不再受支持，建议迁移至受支持的支付处理方案。作为临时缓解措施，确保 MCK 运行目录的粘滞位（sticky bit）已设置，限制非信任用户访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-2000-0067","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4382b0b8593e7ef30616ab300314afbbf1571636/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0067.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0067","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/919d6cac5eadae13826d4a35bab84cf2bac57965/2000/CVE-2000-0067.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0067.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/29756569ae7c866e39492d6faf2dcdff310590f7/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-98fp-r246-5cjg/GHSA-98fp-r246-5cjg.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/cae595683b6fe65324ec717750e7cdca928c1db7/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0067.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88254/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152100_152200.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/3f03bd7f1d1606d853ca070d5f0897c51e140c86/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0053.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0209","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0209.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0081","title":"Microsoft Hotmail JavaScript代码过滤远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Hotmail 邮件系统未对用户邮箱中的 JavaScript 代码进行有效过滤，远程攻击者可通过构造包含十六进制编码的 javascript: 协议（如 j&#x41;vascript）的恶意邮件，当收件人打开邮件时触发 JavaScript 代码执行，导致敏感信息泄露或会话劫持。该漏洞影响 Hotmail 邮件服务，利用方式简单，危害严重，CVSS 评分 10.0。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0081"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-01-10T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:57.650","remediation":"Microsoft 已在 Hotmail 服务端更新邮件内容过滤引擎，对十六进制编码的 `javascript:` 协议字符串进行递归解码检测，阻止所有经过编码混淆的脚本协议执行。用户无需操作，确保浏览器启用默认安全设置即可。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-2000-0081","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2000/CVE-2000-0081.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7f33768789fe75b3288b56f0d11b0df1d5f4a5d4/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0081.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0081","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/922354cca15ef3923415d02f4397f929a0208531/2000/CVE-2000-0081.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0081.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d67487551d3c04e5942b9b8e11c25937ecfba21c/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0081.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88237/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001094.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/5116d66f715b098d7dc74f3fb3559215242e5dbf/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0209.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0108","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0108.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0046","title":"Mirabilis ICQ 99b 远程缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Mirabilis ICQ 99b 1.1.1.1 客户端存在远程缓冲区溢出漏洞。攻击者可通过向目标用户发送特制的畸形 URL 链接，在 ICQ 消息解析过程中触发缓冲区溢出，从而在受害者系统上以当前用户权限执行任意命令。该漏洞影响 ICQ 99b 1.1.1.1 及 3.19 等版本，无需身份认证，只需诱使用户点击消息中的恶意链接即可触发，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。当时官方未发布正式补丁，建议用户升级到更高版本或停止使用受影响版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0046"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-01-10T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:53.383","remediation":"立即升级 ICQ 客户端至 2000a 或更新版本，该版本已修复 URL 消息处理中的缓冲区溢出漏洞。如无法升级，建议停止使用 ICQ 99b 并迁移至其他即时通讯软件，或在网络边界过滤异常 ICQ 消息流量作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/929","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19724","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a986b2f03c729ac57ae7d269a03d86211c579de0/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0046.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0046","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0046.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/834e72bf1d790a78930554cd283f772f3690fc67/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0046.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/icq_vulns.nasl","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/pre2008/icq_installed.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0046.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--69e67c4e-76b5-4fa4-90c5-5a1691ae56f8.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001093.txt","https://github.com/akabe1/windows_exploit_dowser/blob/11b24e36173cd382721db28581e575faf687d06b/cve_from_exploitdb_website.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0108.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0067","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0067.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0080","title":"IBM AIX techlibss 符号链接漏洞","description":"IBM AIX 系统的 techlibss 组件存在符号链接漏洞，本地攻击者可通过在目标系统上创建恶意的符号链接文件，诱使 techlibss 以高权限访问并覆盖任意文件，从而实现权限提升或破坏系统关键文件。该漏洞需要攻击者拥有本地访问权限，利用难度较低，影响 AIX 多个版本，CVSS 评分 2.1，危害等级低。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0080"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-01-10T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:57.527","remediation":"升级 AIX 系统上的 techlib.service.rte 文件集至 1.0.0.4 或更高版本（2000 年 1 月服务 CD 中提供）。该文件集不会随自动更新安装，需手动使用 `installp -aX -d /dev/cd0 techlib.service.rte` 命令强制升级。如无法立即升级，可临时移除 techlibss 的 SUID 位以缓解风险：`chmod -s /usr/lpp/techlib/techlibss`。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=94757136413681&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/931","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7f33768789fe75b3288b56f0d11b0df1d5f4a5d4/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0080.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0080","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0080.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1d32b25dbea4bacedc1131a8702fa8adcc181eee/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0080.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/5da0a5f6cef8a27d290daf0d2c65fed1d1f621b9/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-c9j2-8536-x27c/GHSA-c9j2-8536-x27c.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0080.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--a60e0b1a-1795-470b-808a-770d843d8ba2.json","https://github.com/dong-xs/Vul-PAG/blob/7eb3b32094a5270cfd8495366e0e4a7df5a874ce/aspect_prediction/org_pred_diff.txt","https://github.com/williamjsmail/piranha/blob/e60f12e6edcde8585ee473f701c2421f6efe72d9/CVE2CAPEC/database/CVE-2000.jsonl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0067.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0846","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0846.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1221","title":"RedHat Linux / SGI IRIX lpr lpd 远程命令执行漏洞","description":"Linux 发行版中 lpr 软件包的行式打印机守护进程（lpd）存在认证绕过漏洞。该漏洞源于 lpd 在验证客户端身份时，仅通过反向解析攻击者 IP 的主机名与 gethostname 返回的打印服务器主机名进行比对，未实施任何加密或签名验证。远程攻击者只需控制目标 DNS 解析，将自身 IP 的反向解析结果伪造为打印服务器主机名，即可绕过访问控制，未经授权向 lpd 发送打印任务，甚至可能利用 lpd 的权限执行任意命令。该漏洞影响 RedHat 6.1、IRIX 6.5.18 等多款操作系统，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1221"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2000-01-08T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:24.660","remediation":"立即停止并禁用 lpd 服务（`service lpd stop && chkconfig lpd off`），该服务已过时且存在严重远程执行漏洞。如必须使用行式打印功能，建议迁移至 CUPS（Common Unix Printing System）替代 lpd。对于无法升级的遗留系统，在 `/etc/hosts.allow` 中添加 `lpd: ALL` 限制访问来源，并在防火墙层面仅允许受信任 IP 访问 TCP 515 端口作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2000-002.html","http://www.atstake.com/research/advisories/2000/lpd_advisory.txt","http://www.debian.org/security/2000/20000109","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/30308","http://www.l0pht.com/advisories/lpd_advisory","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/927","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/3840","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19722","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2000/CVE-2000-1221.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6e1fee15e021f95477107e3e5d652470f76f7bac/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1221.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1221","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ad583e79ed38e32f21eec5f8962c8f59146c10bc/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1221.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-1221.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/9608541b971a314a928294c8f88371b45ef3f307/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-7g6p-865f-j3r5/GHSA-7g6p-865f-j3r5.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cwe_details/cwe_details_0_100.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--654704b0-61ca-416f-ae82-a0392cba1e03.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idbypass","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/f352dfaf39e3e89c1c3ab384d9e74e4219126910/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0846.toml"}]